# API Test Demo

## Create new customer and account. Then activate and deposit to new created account
* Create customer "customer.json"
* Status code must be "200"
* Content type must be "json"
* Create account for selected customer
* Status code must be "200"
* Content type must be "json"
* Activate selected account
* Status code must be "200"
* Content type must be "json"
* Deposit "30.00" to selected account